OL,3,GNEWSADalglish charity donates #1m to
OL,4,Astruggling hospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity founded by Marina Dalglish
OL,7,Fhas donated #1m to a struggling
OL,8,Fhospice.
OL,10,FLady Dalglish announced the donation to
OL,11,FQueenscourt Hospice in Southport,
OL,12,FMerseyside, at a fundraising event for
OL,13,Fthe charity on Saturday.
OL,15,FEarlier this year, the hospice warned
OL,16,Fit faced closure within 18 months
OL,17,Funless it could overcome its worst
OL,18,Ffinancial crisis in 35 years.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
