OL,3,GNEWSADalglish charity donates #1m to
OL,4,Astruggling hospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hospice's executive medical
OL,7,Fdirector Dr Clare Finnegan said they
OL,8,Fwere "hugely grateful" to Lady Dalglish
OL,9,Fand Sir Kenny Dalglish for their
OL,10,Fsupport, with the #1m donation being
OL,11,F"the cherry on the top of the cake"
OL,12,Fafter an evening of fundraising.
